 SG_ Value : 8|16@1- (1,0) [-32768|32767] "" SIM_PLANT

BO_ 1808 SIM_Truth: 8 SIM_PLANT
 SG_ SimTime : 0|32@1+ (1e-06,0) [0|4294.967295] "s" GATEWAY
 SG_ TrueKingpinAngle : 32|16@1- (0.001,0) [-32.768|32.767] "rad" GATEWAY
